          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "доспехи (dospékhi) is usually traced to доспеть \"to get ready\", from the root of спех \"haste\" and успех \"success\": the gear made ready. EtymDB lists no parent."
            }
